<section id="studio" aria-labelledby="studioTitle">
<style>
#studio{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 0}#studio h2{font:500 2.1rem Georgia,serif;margin:0}#studio .views{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(270px,100%),1fr));gap:12px;margin:14px 0}#studio figure{margin:0;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:var(--panel)}#studio figcaption{margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600}#studio canvas{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:5/3;background:#122824}#studio input{max-width:100%}#studioSources button{margin:4px 6px 0 0}#studioArchive{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
#dreamGallery{display:flex;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto}#dreamGallery figure{flex:0 0 150px;padding:5px}#dreamGallery canvas{aspect-ratio:auto}#dreamGallery figcaption{font-size:13px}#dreaming{margin:18px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
</style><h2 id="studioTitle">Multistream imagination</h2>
<p>Add sources to a shared scene. Each sampled scene is saved in this browser. Every available visual memory contributes to the context for the next imagined frame.</p>
<div class="controls"><label>Example<select id="mixExample"></select></label><button class="primary" id="mixAdd">Add example</button><button id="mixCamera">Add webcam</button><label>Add video files<input id="mixFiles" type="file" accept="video/*" multiple></label><label>Video stream URL<input id="mixUrl" type="url" placeholder="https://…/video.webm"></label><button id="mixStream">Add stream</button><label>Output resolution<select id="mixResolution"><option value="160">160 × 96</option><option value="320" selected>320 × 192</option><option value="640">640 × 384</option><option value="1280">1280 × 720 (HD)</option><option value="1920">1920 × 1080 (Full HD)</option></select></label><label>Imagination horizon<select id="mixHorizon"><option value="1">1 step</option><option value="4">4 steps</option><option value="8">8 steps</option></select></label></div>
<label><span><input type="checkbox" id="mixSeparate" checked> Also remember each individual feed</span></label><div id="studioSources" aria-label="Remove individual inputs"></div><div class="views"><figure><figcaption>Combined observation</figcaption><canvas id="mixScene" width="320" height="192"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>Recurrent visual activity</figcaption><canvas id="mixNetwork" width="480" height="288"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>Imagined continuation</figcaption><canvas id="mixDream" width="320" height="192"></canvas></figure></div>
<div class="controls"><button id="mixImagine">Imagine from memory</button><button id="mixStop">Stop studio</button><label>Starting episode<select id="mixEpisode"><option value="">Latest</option></select></label><button id="mixImage" disabled>Save imagined PNG</button><button id="mixExport">Export studio memories</button><button id="mixClear">Clear studio archive</button></div>
<section id="dreaming" aria-labelledby="dreamTitle"><h3 id="dreamTitle">Dreaming</h3>
<p>Let remembered fragments drift into invented places, or start with an empty archive. Dreams appear in the imagined continuation panel above.</p>
<div class="controls"><button class="primary" id="dreamStart">Start dreaming</button><button id="dreamPause" disabled>Pause dream</button><button id="dreamStep" disabled>Single dream step</button><button id="dreamWake" disabled>Wake</button>
<label>Dream setting<select id="dreamTheme"><option>Drift</option><option>Tidal sky</option><option>Branching garden</option><option>Floating city</option><option>Folded passage</option></select></label>
<label>Associative freedom<input id="dreamFreedom" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="65"></label>
<label>Dream seed<input id="dreamSeed" placeholder="Random" type="number" min="0" max="4294967295" step="1"></label>
<button id="dreamStrip" disabled>Save dream strip</button><button id="dreamJournal" disabled>Export dream journal</button></div><p id="dreamReadout" role="status"></p><div id="dreamGallery" aria-label="Recent dream scenes"></div></section>
<p id="studioArchive"></p><p id="studioStatus" role="status">Select a stimulus to start. Adding a webcam requests video access.</p></section>
